            "type": "text",
            "text": "A rabbit with long, black fur all over the body that was homozygous at both loci was crossed with a rabbit with short, white fur that was homozygous at both loci. The F1 offspring had short, black fur. These F1 rabbits were mated together to become the parents of the F2 generation.",
